# after the one non-Claude review passes, CI is green and a run-proof is present (decisions
# ledger 2026-11-04). The owner-only block at the end keeps the gate, the checks and the
# reserved classes his: GitHub's Actions hardening guide says to code-own workflow files,
# and its code owners docs say to own this file. Last match wins.
